          "content": "## Manual QA: corrected D50 tender briefing\n\nRun once after the original r1 source is delivered and before rendering the corrected canonical D50. The fixture reads the exact synthetic QA source and verifies that no r2 details exist. It clones the five r1 details as r2, then updates only primary revision and updated_at. Existing source receipt columns, r1 details, ledger, accepted job and Drive asset remain retained.\n\nNo render, Drive or Data Table nodes are present. Repeated or partial runs stop for manual reconciliation. Sheets updates are not one transaction. After the verified r2 receipt, root must run the newly imported canonical D50, review its new video and recapture its canvas. This fixture is inactive and excluded from publication."
        }
